{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026bx9YfnZ7Jh1792042147.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>承接外圍跌勢，港股一度跌300多點。</p><p></p><p>恒指低開232點後，最多跌過380多點，下試23,300點水平。科網股普遍受壓，阿里巴巴跌近半成，騰訊也跌百分之3，百度業績後急跌百分之6，為表現最差藍籌。</p><p></p><p>加息預期升溫，拖累金融股向下，滙控及友邦跌百分之1。晶片股逆市向上，華虹及中芯升百分之8至9。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T06:29:32.043828+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":145,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T05:22:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T06:20:10.290779+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T06:22:53.233007+00:00","content_hash":"7d604e0727195f1ce034f5c45fa502a510b445df31561073a45cebfe45397e0f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-17T06:29:32.043828+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}